DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
22248::$$$message_0175_0000_0000$$$::The sky is clear.[lr]::
22249::$$$message_0175_0000_0001$$$::The strong sunlight numbs my sense of the seasons.[lr]::
22250::$$$message_0175_0000_0002$$$::The sea breeze brushing against my cheeks feels good, and the cries of the black-tailed gulls ease my loneliness.[lr]::
22251::$$$message_0175_0000_0003$$$::A perfect location that brings no complaints.[lr]::
22252::$$$message_0175_0000_0004$$$::The port that almost symbolizes the peaceful Fuyuki City. However...::
22253::$$$message_0175_0001_0000$$$::It's crowded as if the Day of the Dead and New Years came at the same time...![lr]::
22254::$$$message_0175_0001_0001$$$::"There's even more now!?"[lr]::
22255::$$$message_0175_0001_0002$$$::It goes without saying who or what increased.[lr]::
22256::$$$message_0175_0001_0003$$$::The figure launching the rod like a big catch flag is without a doubt...!::
22257::$$$message_0175_0002_0000$$$::"Woah, cool! Gil, is that a fish!? It's a fish, huh! Woah, a fish!!! Give me one!"[lr]::
22258::$$$message_0175_0002_0001$$$::"Gil Gil. The third line is moving. Can I reel it in?"[lr]::
22259::$$$message_0175_0002_0002$$$::"Huh, that guy's rod looks cheap. Your rod is golden and cool, Gil. Although it looks dumb."[lr]::
22260::$$$message_0175_0002_0003$$$::"Gil, where's this week's comic book?"[lr]::
22261::$$$message_0175_0002_0004$$$::"Wow, you caught so many! Hey Gil, can I throw a fish at that guy behind you?"::
22262::$$$message_0175_0003_0000$$$::"Ha ha ha. You mongrels are being too loud. You're bothering the mole crickets around you.[lr]::
22263::$$$message_0175_0003_0001$$$::More than that, Jirou, you should take home not just one but ten to twenty fish. Mimi, there's nothing to fear. I won't be mad, so try reeling it in. [cacheimage storage=ギル私服b01b(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ギル私服b01b(遠)]Imahisa, I won't be bothered even if you state the obvious. But you have good taste; go buy a popsicle with this. [cacheimage storage=ギル私服b01a(遠)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ギル私服b01a(遠)]Kanta, wait until I finish reading the comic book. Kouta, that's a mad dog, so be careful when throwing."::
22264::$$$message_0175_0004_0000$$$::"...Who are you?"[lr]::
22265::$$$message_0175_0004_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Umm.[font italic=false][lr]::
22266::$$$message_0175_0004_0002$$$::[font italic=true]If I had to say, then the children's...He...ro...?[font italic=false]::
22267::$$$message_0175_0005_0000$$$::"But how disappointing, I heard there was one who calls himself the strongest, but this is nothing! After all it's just a guard dog and a faker; they don't compare to me, who is a King!"[lr]::
22268::$$$message_0175_0005_0001$$$::The hero laughs in delight.[lr]::
22269::$$$message_0175_0005_0002$$$::His hair and cheeks are pulled by the kids at times.::
22270::$$$message_0175_0006_0000$$$::"Heh. A quantity strategy as always, huh? And to even have the latest equipment regardless of cost.[lr]::
22271::$$$message_0175_0006_0001$$$::...I'm disappointed. How despicable of you to rely on tools, King of Heroes...!"[lr]::
22272::$$$message_0175_0006_0002$$$::Surrounded by children, the man in red catches fish trying not to lose.[lr]::
22273::$$$message_0175_0006_0003$$$::Well, [large]look who's talking.[rf]::
22274::$$$message_0175_0007_0000$$$::"Hm? Says you whose reel is a super automation device that's sold out everyday at the fishing tackle store.[lr]::
22275::$$$message_0175_0007_0001$$$::Interesting. My reel is inferior, but my rod is custom made. Why don't we compete to see whose equipment is more superior, you peasant...!"[lr]::
22276::$$$message_0175_0007_0002$$$::"T-That's the legendary Electric Shock Gamakatsu 2006...!!![lr]::
22277::$$$message_0175_0007_0003$$$::Why do you have the rod that got discontinued at the prototype stage...!?"::
22278::$$$message_0175_0008_0000$$$::"That's my dad's. Gil said he will play with me if I steal it."[lr]::
22279::$$$message_0175_0008_0001$$$::The children run towards him.[lr]::
22280::$$$message_0175_0008_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
22281::$$$message_0175_0008_0003$$$::And the man in blue who hasn't been joining the conversation at all.::
22282::$$$message_0175_0009_0000$$$::"Nonsense...! Are you really a Heroic Spirit, mobilizing innocent children like that...!?[lr]::
22283::$$$message_0175_0009_0001$$$::Well, how about we make it so that the winner obtains this rod...!?"[lr]::
22284::$$$message_0175_0009_0002$$$::"Very well![lr]::
22285::$$$message_0175_0009_0003$$$::I do not need your fake, but I shall receive that reel anyway!"::
22286::$$$message_0175_0010_0000$$$::"Wow! A duel between Gil and a fishing pro! How rare! I'll go get my dad!"[lr]::
22287::$$$message_0175_0010_0001$$$::"Don't lose, get him! Go, red guy!"[lr]::
22288::$$$message_0175_0010_0002$$$::"Don't just catch filefish or yellowtail, catch some flatfish too. But please don't catch an octopus like the guy behind us!" [lr]::
22289::$$$message_0175_0010_0003$$$::"Hey, hey, Gil. More than that, let me read the comic book already."::
22290::$$$message_0175_0011_0000$$$::There is no longer peace and quiet at the port.[lr]::
22291::$$$message_0175_0011_0001$$$::The King of Heroes who surprisingly likes children, and the man in red that is for some reason popular with the children.[lr]::
22292::$$$message_0175_0011_0002$$$::And...::
22293::$$$message_0175_0012_0000$$$::"Hey Mister, are you catching any fish?"[lr]::
22294::$$$message_0175_0012_0001$$$::"...I beg you. Give me back my paradise."[lr]::
22295::$$$message_0175_0012_0002$$$::"Mister" Lancer droops his head, with an expression like the world is ending.::
22296::$$$message_0175_0013_0000$$$::"...I'm leaving. This is no longer a place where ordinary people can be..."[lr]::
22297::$$$message_0175_0013_0001$$$::I leave the port.[lr]::
22298::$$$message_0175_0013_0002$$$::I feel dizzy just from looking up at the endless sky.[lr]::
22299::$$$message_0175_0013_0003$$$::I sigh.[lr]::
22300::$$$message_0175_0013_0004$$$::Lancer's lost paradise, at least be eternal in his memories[line len=3]���s